<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Aquatic Growing Zone-->
  <VCE_AquaticGrowingZone>水生种植区</VCE_AquaticGrowingZone>
  <!--EN: Create a zone where your colonists will try to grow aquatic plants. Aquatic plants ignore terrain fertility but take a very long time to sow and harvest.\n\nThese zones can't be placed on oceanic (salty) water.-->
  <VCE_AquaticGrowingZoneDesc>创建一片可供殖民者种植某种水生作物的区域。水生作物不受肥沃度影响，但需要花费更多的时间来播种与收割。\n\n不能设置在海水上。</VCE_AquaticGrowingZoneDesc>
  <!--EN: Green beans planted nearby: {0}/100-->
  <VCE_BeansNearby>附近的豆角：{0}/100</VCE_BeansNearby>
  <!--EN: Carrots planted nearby: {0}/100-->
  <VCE_CarrotsNearby>附近的胡萝卜：{0}/100</VCE_CarrotsNearby>
  <!--EN: Flower Garden Zone-->
  <VCE_FlowerGardenGrowingZone>花园区</VCE_FlowerGardenGrowingZone>
  <!--EN: Create a zone where your colonists will try to grow decorative flowers.-->
  <VCE_FlowerGardenGrowingZoneDesc>创建一个区域，让您的殖民者尝试种植装饰性花卉。</VCE_FlowerGardenGrowingZoneDesc>
  <!--EN: Sand Growing Zone-->
  <VCE_SandyGrowingZone>沙地种植区</VCE_SandyGrowingZone>
  <!--EN: Create a zone where your colonists will try to grow sandy terrain plants. Sand plants ignore terrain fertility but take a very long time to sow and harvest.-->
  <VCE_SandyGrowingZoneDesc>创建一片可供殖民者种植沙地作物的区域。沙地作物不受肥沃度影响，但需要花费更多的时间来播种与收割。</VCE_SandyGrowingZoneDesc>
</LanguageData>
